# Archiver config

- **Submission sources / preservation policy:** **`config/preservation/submission-sources.yaml`** and **`docs/oais-bagit-preservation-plan.md`**.
- **Examples only in git:** `batch.yml.example`, templates under **`config/`** — copy to ignored local names for real batches.
- **Do not commit** `data/` from test runs, ClamAV prod paths, or Wasabi/Omeka credentials (private config repo).

Changing catalog or ingest limits: update **`docs/config-contract.md`** (if present) and keep Omeka test stack fields aligned per **`hitsave-omeka-test/docs/config-contract.md`**.
